cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this artifact, please cite both the artifact and the paper it
  accompanies.
title: >-
  Artifact for "Put the Post-Quantum Signature First: Format-Layer Downgrade
  Resistance in Sequential Hybrid PDF Signing"
abstract: >-
  Code, signed PDF artifacts, test trust anchors and validator logs
  reproducing every experimental figure in the paper. Includes the
  attack and mitigation experiments, the pyHanko and EU DSS 6.5
  cross-validation harnesses, and the verifier-rule probes.
authors:
